  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for teacher development and professionalism in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This projects aims at consolidating the gains that have been made in Ghana with the Norwegian Teacher Initiative (NTI) . The key activities will include support National Teaching Council (NTC) to organize 2-day symposium for teachers as part of the 2024 World Teachers Day (WTD) celebration. Further activities include supporting UNESCO&apos;s participation in GPE programme development working sessions at the national level. Finally, there will be follow up workshops on the Comprehensive National Teacher Policy (CNTP) implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
